>>>>>>
>>>>> 5. Replace slot "numtrees" with the number of subsamples
>>>>>
>>>>>> sub.rma at numtrees <- length(subtrees)
>>>>>>
>>>>> 6. Check if the new ExprTreeSet is correct:
