I think the OP wants to map aliases to official gene symbols rather than 
mapping affy probe ids to symbols.

Something like this should work:

 > library(org.Hs.eg.db)
 > eg <- get("GAB", org.Hs.egALIAS2EG)
 > symb <- get(eg, org.Hs.egSYMBOL)
 > symb
[1] "A1BG"

You can also do these things directly using sql statements if 
interested, see the AnnotationDbi vignette for examples.

Best,

Jim



