To answer this part of your question, you can get the probeset.csv  
file from:
http://www.affymetrix.com/analysis/downloads/current_exon/

The PGF/CLF can be found at:
http://www.affymetrix.com/support/technical/libraryfilesmain.affx

Look for "Mouse Exon 1.0 ST Array Analysis (zip, 114 MB)", which after  
logging in, will get you:
MoEx-1_0-st-v1.r2.zip

There are plans to make a couple versions of Mouse CDFs for use with  
FIRMA within aroma.affymetrix.  I'm not sure when that will actually  
be, but hopefully "soon".


