>
> I have a question about an Agilent rat platform. We are studying a
> cross-platform issue and one of the platform is using G4130A, which bench
> scientists provide as limited information. I guess it is rgug4130a but how
> could I confirm this? what rgug stands for?
>
> btw, what's the difference between rgug4130a.db and rgug4130a? Is there any
> general readme for annotation packages?
>
> Thanks,
>
